  "sourceText": "Avocado Salsa For Fish\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Thursday, December 10, 2009 - 11:29pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 lrg avocado mashed\n1/4 cup onion finely minced\n2 teaspoons lime juice\n2 teaspoons olive oil\n1/4 teaspoon Tabasco sauce\n2 teaspoons dried cilantro or parsley\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Combine all ingredients well. Serve in small individual bowls at room temperature. 2 Makes 1 cup",
